<BaseLayout title="Privacy | Chandraprakash Darji">
  <div class="layout space-y-6 py-20">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight">Privacy</h1>
    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-muted-foreground"><p>This personal portfolio publishes my projects and technical writing. It loads Umami analytics from unami.rega.run to measure page visits and interactions such as opening a project or following a contact link. The site also loads fonts from Google Fonts. Requests to these services expose connection information to their operators.</p><p>Your theme preferences are stored in your browser using local storage so the site can remember your chosen appearance. Contact links open email, social networks, GitHub, or Cal.com; those services handle information under their own policies. If you email me, your email provider and mine process that correspondence. Avoid sending passwords, access tokens, or other secrets. For questions about this site's data handling, email <a href="mailto:me@elregaldo.com">me@elregaldo.com</a>.</p></div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
